Apple today <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/10/26/apple-announces-ipad-mini-with-oled-display/">announced</a> the first OLED iPad mini, and it carries a pretty hefty price increase compared to just a few years ago. The new model starts at &#36;699, up &#36;100 (or 17%) from the &#36;599 starting price of the previous generation model. <br/>
